# Mission

Build an AI-assisted Sales Engine so one person can run new-business, activation, reactivation, and Partner development.

Governing KPI: **800 paying Portal Genie registrations by February 2027.**

Every feature must materially contribute to at least one of:

1. Generating new paying registrations
2. Increasing conversion of existing leads
3. Increasing activation/usage of registered accounts
4. Creating and activating referral Partners
5. Generating qualified sales conversations
6. Improving conversion rates
7. Reducing manual sales administration

If it does not, do not prioritise it.

Guiding question when uncertain:

> What is the highest-leverage thing we can build now that increases the probability of reaching 800 paying registrations by February 2027 while minimising human sales workload?

Registration is not the final conversion event. Prioritise the journey through activation, habit, paying, expansion, Partner, and referrals.

Do not silently change these business rules.
